# not source files — regenerate them by re-running those two scripts rather
# than committing large binary/data blobs to Git. Comment out any of these
# if your team specifically WANTS them version-controlled (e.g. to guarantee
# everyone demos with the exact same trained model without re-running
# training on every machine).
